618 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Upgrading is driven by emotion\054 not just need\050Rohit\031s existing devices are often still functional\054 but excitement\054 FOMO\054 tech trends and marketing encourage him to buy the newest model\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 619 0 R
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

619 0 obj
  << /K [ 618 0 R ]
     /P 630 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

620 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The old device becomes an afterthought\050Once the new device is purchased\054 the old phone moves from being a valuable product to something that needs to be dealt with\056 This creates accumulation and clutter\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 621 0 R
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

621 0 obj
  << /K [ 620 0 R ]
     /P 630 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

622 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Trade\055in is convenient\054 but the afterlife is unclear\050Trading in the old device makes upgrading easier\054 but Rohit has little visibility into whether the device is reused\054 refurbished\054 resold or discarded\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 623 0 R
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

623 0 obj
  << /K [ 622 0 R ]
     /P 630 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

624 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Financial value can motivate responsible behaviour\050Rohit responds strongly to value\054 discounts\054 trade\055in offers and getting something back for his old technology\056 Sustainability can therefore be paired with a tangible financial incentive\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 625 0 R
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

625 0 obj
  << /K [ 624 0 R ]
     /P 630 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

626 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Convenience is critical to behaviour change\050If responsible disposal requires multiple steps\054 users are likely to postpone it\056 The sustainable option needs to be as easy and immediate as buying or trading in a new device\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 627 0 R
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

627 0 obj
  << /K [ 626 0 R ]
     /P 630 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

628 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Trust is a major barrier\050Rohit has concerns around personal data\054 the condition of refurbished devices and what happens to his old device after handing it over\056 Transparency can reduce this uncertainty\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 629 0 R
     /Pg 616 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

